<title>USA: Vencor completes acquisition of TheraTx.</title>
<headline>Vencor completes acquisition of TheraTx.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said Turesday that it has acquired about 99 percent of the common stock of TheraTx Inc through its tender offer for TheraTx common, which expred at 1200 EST/1700 GMT today.</p>
<p>Each remaining share of TheraTx will be converted into the right to receive $17.10 cash said the company.</p>
<p>Vencor said it plans to delist TheraTx from trading on the Nasdaq Stock Market.</p>
</text>
